    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Prayer in Difficult Times"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: according to “The Lily of Testimony.” A Miktam of David for teaching. When he fought with Aram-naharaim and Aram-zobah, and Joab returned and struck Edom in Salt Valley, killing twelve thousand."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, you have rejected us;",
          "you have broken us down;",
          "you have been angry. Restore us! ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have shaken the land and split it open.",
          "Heal its fissures, for it shudders."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have made your people suffer hardship;",
          "you have given us wine to drink",
          "that made us stagger."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have given a signal flag to those who fear you,",
          "so that they can flee before the archers. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Save with your right hand, and answer me,",
          "so that those you love may be rescued."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God has spoken in his sanctuary:",
          "“I will celebrate!",
          "I will divide up Shechem.",
          "I will apportion the Valley of Succoth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Gilead is mine, Manasseh is mine,",
          "and Ephraim is my helmet;",
          "Judah is my scepter."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Moab is my washbasin.",
          "I throw my sandal on Edom;",
          "I shout in triumph over Philistia.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Who will bring me to the fortified city?",
          "Who will lead me to Edom?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, haven’t you rejected us?",
          "God, you do not march out with our armies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Give us aid against the foe,",
          "for human help is worthless."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "With God we will perform valiantly;",
          "he will trample our foes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
